#
# Conformance case: characteristic/irreflexive-clash
# Property-characteristic enforcement (H4) — irreflexivity violation.
#
# ex:shadow is typed logic:irreflexiveProperty. Given the self-pair
# ex:G shadow ex:G, the native characteristic pass must raise
# logic:violation logic:IrreflexivityViolation on ex:G — a goal is never its
# own shadow. The chase seeds only from input.nq; this is the mirror axiom.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/characteristic/irreflexive-clash/> .

ex:shadow a logic:irreflexiveProperty .
ex:G ex:shadow ex:G .
